| Content Type    | Before (tokens) | After (tokens) | Reduction |
|----------------|-----------------|----------------|-----------|
| Large JSON API  | 10,144          | 1,260          | **88%**   |
| Python codebase | 8,500           | 2,100          | **75%**   |
